 built-in wardrobes, three bathrooms, a maid’s room and a spacious balcony, creating the perfect home for comfortable everyday living.<br> <br> Perfectly positioned in the heart of Palm Jumeirah, Golden Mile offers one of the best lifestyles on the island. With Palm West Beach just across the road on one side and the private Shoreline beach clubs on the other, you’ll enjoy the best of beachfront living. Golden Mile Galleria is right on your doorstep, offering an array of cafés, restaurants, boutiques, supermarkets, Fitness First, beauty salons and everyday conveniences, while Nakheel Mall is just a short stroll away.","longitude":55.1342009,"negotiator_id":"531","negotiator_mapping":"evelyn@providentestate.com","parking":["1"],"price":199000,"price_qualifier":null,"publish":1,"search_type":"lettings","slug":"2-bedroom-apartment-to-rent-in-golden-mile-5-golden-mile-palm-jumeirah-dubai","status":"To Let","thumbnail":"http://provident-bx-upload-eu.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/iblock/73c/73c6b7bec1c213f12aa482d079290ba9/DSC05039_HDR.jpg","title":"2 bedroom apartment to rent","extra":{"views":"","cheques":"1","project":null,"bitrix_id":"1479756","furnished":"Unfurnished","permit_number":"7113720502","rental_period":"Yearly","current_status":"","furnishing_type":"Unfurnished","completion_status":"completed","property_condition":"","property_managed_by_us":""},"video_tour":[],"virtual_tour":[],"qr_code":null,"premium":0,"link_to_employee":{"id":"531","url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/prov-email-signatures/Evelyn-Jamieson-PFB.png","name":"Evelyn Jamieson","email":"evelyn@providentestate.com","phone":"+971 50 476 0879","brn_number":"49357"},"developer":"","ggfx_results":[{"id":6075775,"src_cftle":"i/property/PR-2006261/crm_negotiator_id/prov-email-signatures/Evelyn-Jamieson-PFB.png","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/property/PR-2006261/crm_negotiator_id/prov-email-signatures/60t70/Evelyn-Jamieson-PFB.webp","alias":"crm_negot